  "notes": "The 2022 stripes in Beach sand, worn by the aircraft tagged with it in airframes/CFG.json. Everything but the stripe color is copied from CFG/standard (Island green, the default): when standard's drawing changes, change it here too (the five files differ only in id, name, description, sources 6-7, the stripe color and these notes). The color was measured off sources 6 and 7, the midtone of the sunlit stripes: #BAA472 between the two photos (#BCA973, #B79E72): a grayer, greener sand than the old note's #C2A060. Low warm sun turns it straw yellow (D-ANRO, 2025-12-02).",
  "history": "Split from CFG/standard on 2026-11-22, which had noted the other four colors in words."
